== Walkthrough ==

You say, 'Hail, Sanfyrd Featherhead'

: Sanfyrd Featherhead says 'Greetings! I am the operator of this scrapyard. If you have any scrap metal, I would be glad to purchase it from you in loads of four.  The Gemchoppers no longer allow me to accept blackbox fragments and micro servos.'

'''Give [[scrap metal]] to Sanfyrd four at a time''' for some experience, money, a random item and the following faction changes:

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction with [[King AkAnon]] got better.
* Your faction with [[Merchants of AkAnon]] got better.
* Your faction with [[Gem Choppers]] got better.
* Your faction with [[Dark Reflection]] got worse.
* Your faction with [[Clan Grikbar]] got worse.
</div>

You will get one of several random items out of this.  Often it is [[Rusty Weapons]].  One unusual item is the [[Gnome Glow Rod]], which acts as a light source.

''Occasionally you get a "Tinmizer's Fabulous Compactor", which is a 0 slot container (!) with a combine button.  This is for the Tinmeizer quest.''

